Approach: Traverse both linked lists simultaneously, add corresponding digits along with the carry, create a new node for the digit, and continue until both lists and the carry are exhausted.

Time Complexity: O(max(n, m)) — each node from both linked lists is processed exactly once.

Space Complexity: O(max(n, m)) — a new linked list is created to store the result.

